@title 3D view: device problem and refused copy are triangles (1366x768)
@area 3D
@sizes 1366x768
# T3: -K1 stands off the small plate: the check is a red triangle on it in 3D. A click opens its popover; Locate selects the device; Escape closes it. Refused edits (no room for a copy) are a yellow triangle on the selection that goes on the next input.
open qa/fixtures/cabinet-3d-no-room.novo
wait 20
click_text 3D #1
wait 40
shot triangle-on-device
check_layout
# A refusal: select -F1, ask for a copy, no free room on the plate.
click 556 270
wait 8
key ctrl+k
text duplicate the selected devices in 3d
wait 5
key Enter
wait 10
expect "No room for a copy"
shot refusal-triangle
check_layout
# The next input ends it.
click 300 600
wait 8
expect_not "No room for a copy"
shot refusal-gone

# The triangle on -K1: a click opens its popover.
click 771 425
wait 8
expect "Locate"
expect "Waive"
shot popover
check_layout
click_text Locate Button
wait 8
expect_not "Locate"
